units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 1.0
timestep 0.001

region box block 0 20 0 20 0 75 units box
create_box 1 box

region target block 0 20 0 20 0 40 units box
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 55 75 units box

create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile

mass 1 92.90638

group target region target
group projectile region projectile

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp etotal press

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix eq all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
run 100000
unfix eq

velocity projectile add 0.0 0.0 -20.0

fix md all nve
run 200000